{"id": 759112, "slug": "crystal-ball-of-firmament", "name": "Crystal Ball of Firmament", "name_original": "Crystal Ball of Firmament", "description": "<p><strong>Description:</strong></p>\n<p>The spell book is missing! Help the magician to find it in this <strong>#action</strong> <strong>#platformer</strong> adventure. Use the crystal ball to change asters position to make your path, collect tokens and buy useful upgrades.\r\n</p>\n<p><strong>UPDATE #2</strong>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed ghost desync.\r\n</li><li>Fixed audio don't save options (Not HTML5).\r\n</li></ul>\n<p><strong>UPDATE #1</strong>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed head decapitation when dead (HTML5).\r\n</li><li>No player control when dead.\r\n</li><li>Backgrounded environment elements.\r\n</li><li>Changed some sprites.\r\n</li><li>Added level counter.\r\n</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong>\n</p>\n<p>Entry made for <strong>#NoticeMe</strong> game jam in two weeks. Art, code, music and most of sound effects were made during this period. Plays better with gamepad.\r\n</p>\n<p>Enjoy!\r\n</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2022-03-23", "tba": false, "updated": "2022-03-25T08:31:24", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/0fa/0fa42cbfe388de75bff6d954deef0b3b.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/df3/df383c9eeca9a8a47c166cfef17ad2aa.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 134, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "r